info.description:
Optimize your Crunchyroll experience with this custom CSS style, designed to provide a cleaner and more immersive layout while you enjoy your favorite anime.

? Features and Benefits:

- ? Greater immersion in the video player: The player takes up more screen space, reducing distractions and focusing on your viewing experience;
- ✨ Minimalist interface: The top bar is automatically minimized but can be expanded by hovering, ensuring quick access when needed;
- ? Smooth transitions: Subtle animations provide a fluid and visually pleasing navigation;
- ?️ Less visual clutter: Unnecessary elements are optimized or hidden, keeping the content as the main focus;

? This style is perfect for anyone looking to transform Crunchyroll into a more immersive platform, with an experience similar to other premium streaming services.

style.css:
@media(min-height: 25em) {

    .erc-watch-episode-layout .video-player-spacer {
        max-height: calc(100vh - 1.5rem)
    }

    [class^="app-layout__header"]{
        height: auto;
    }

    :root{
        --app-header-height-value: 3.75rem;
    }

    .erc-large-header{
        transition-property: height;
        transition-duration: 333ms;
        height: 0.75rem;
    }

    .erc-large-header:hover{
        height: var(--app-header-height-value, 3.75rem);
    }

    .erc-large-header .header-content {
        top: -3rem;
        transition-property:  top;
        transition-duration: 333ms;
    }

    .erc-large-header:hover  .header-content{
        top: 0;
    }
}
